  state: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d9a62349d93a8aa438a733a645bd7e1f, type: 2}
  isAutomatic: 0
  ChangeTimeOfAction: 0
  Text: "We told him about the CLEANING CREW. \n \n\"It wasn't me who took them!
    She wanted to give the <link>pictures</link> to him, said it was important! But
    yesterday she couldn't find him so she gave them to me. It wasn't me who took
    them. I never lied to any of you, please!\"  \n \n\"I didn't want to get him
    and <link>Miss Marcelle</link> in trouble.\" \n  \n\"<link>Tootsie is at 58 Lamon
    Street</link>, I don't know where she is! I'm not lying I'm really not!\"  \n
    \n"
